Codex welcome animation

The welcome scene in src/welcome-mark.ts adapts the method of the Codex
terminal welcome (codex-rs/tui/src/empty_state_animation in
https://github.com/openai/codex at c9b3924a62): a vector mark extruded with a
bevel, turned in perspective with a depth buffer, lit with key, fill, rim and
gloss terms, and drawn in colored Braille dots, with its timing and focus fade.
